  "colors": "GW",
  "identity": "A GW domain midrange deck whose real resource is basic land TYPES, not mana. Zar Ojanen, Scion of Efrava is the payoff: at five basic land types every attack it makes puts a permanent +1/+1 counter on each creature with toughness 4 or less, and the deck runs two copies. The mana base is built so that every missing basic land type has TWO sources - a typed dual that still taps for green, and a basic that Scout the Wilderness and The Weatherseed Treaty can actually fetch - which takes the deck from reaching domain 5 in about a third of games to about three quarters. The same domain count that fuels the counters also shrinks Leyline Binding toward one mana, turns Jodah's Codex into a near-free draw each turn, and makes Artillery Blast a five-damage removal spell.",
